So you'll have pinching of the nerve and that will cause pain and that can cause pain wherever that nerve is going so that could would follow that nerve.

00:02:03,240 --> 00:02:17,240
So just like if you had a disc that ruptured and ruptured into the vertebral ferramid and pinched the nerve, you'd have pain with your lumbar spine, you'd have pain down your leg.

